{
  "label": "Detail Panel",
  "category": "Contact-Group",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Detail Panel & Audit Trail",
      "id": "detail-panel",
      "intro": "Setiap grup memiliki Detail Panel untuk menginspeksi informasi secara lengkap. Panel ini tersaji dalam format Card View (panel samping animasi) dan Table View (sidebar permanen 22rem), masing-masing dipisahkan ke dalam tab General dan History. Dari sini Anda juga dapat membuka portal View Contacts untuk mengelola anggota dalam grup.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Tab General: Identitas & Metadata Grup",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik salah satu grup pada daftar utama untuk membuka Detail Panel.\n• Pada **Card View**, panel samping terbagi atas:\n  - **Group Identity (Kiri/Atas)**: Menampilkan Group ID, header identitas grup, tombol **View Contacts** (untuk membuka portal manajemen anggota), tombol **Edit Group**, dan **Delete Group**.\n  - **Group Metadata (Kanan)**: Menyajikan Group ID, Group Name, dan Platform komunikasi grup.\n  - **Action Insight (Bawah)**: Catatan ringkas tentang cara mengakses manajemen anggota kontak.\n• Pada **Table View**, Detail Panel tersemat sebagai sidebar permanen lebar `22rem` di sisi kanan halaman dengan header *Group Details*.",
          "color": "#7c3aed",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#fff;width:520px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #ede9fe;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#faf5ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;\"><span style=\"padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;background:#7c3aed;border:1px solid #7c3aed;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">General</span><span style=\"padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;background:transparent;border:1px solid #c4b5fd;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#a78bfa;\">History</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;min-height:220px;\"><div style=\"width:190px;padding:18px;background:#faf5ff;border-right:1px solid #ede9fe;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(45deg,#7c3aed,#06b6d4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;\">Group Identity</span></div><div><div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:900;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.2;\">#3</div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;margin-top:2px;\">Group Information</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"padding:7px;border-radius:8px;background:#7c3aed;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;\">View Contacts</button><button style=\"padding:7px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(124,58,237,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(124,58,237,0.15);color:#7c3aed;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;\">Edit Group</button><button style=\"padding:7px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(239,68,68,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.15);color:#ef4444;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;\">Delete Group</button></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;padding:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:4px;\">Group Metadata</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">Group ID</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">#3</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">Platform</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Email</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;grid-column:span 2;\"><span style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">Group Name</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Risk Team Alpha</span></div></div><div style=\"border-top:1px dashed #e9d5ff;padding-top:10px;margin-top:4px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:6px;\">Action Insight</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.5;\">Overview snapshot dari grup. Akses portal View Contacts untuk manajemen anggota kontak secara lengkap.</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Tab History: Kronologis & Fullscreen Timeline",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tab **History** merekam riwayat audit perubahan grup secara kronologis dari yang terbaru.\n• Log memuat:\n  - **Initiator**: Email user administrator pelaksana perubahan.\n  - **Timestamp**: Waktu eksekusi aksi.\n  - **Status**: Status penyelesaian perubahan (icon operasi Create/Update/Delete).\n  - **Message**: Rincian deskriptif perlakuan sistem terhadap data grup.\n• Klik tombol **Expand Timeline** di pojok kanan atas tab History (pada Card View) untuk memunculkan modal popup fullscreen guna meninjau seluruh audit trail.",
          "color": "#4f46e5",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(124,58,237,.12);border:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#fff;width:340px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#faf5ff;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;background:transparent;border:1px solid #c4b5fd;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;color:#a78bfa;\">General</span><span style=\"padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;background:#7c3aed;border:1px solid #7c3aed;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">History</span></div><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(124,58,237,0.15);font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;border:1px solid #c4b5fd;\">Expand Timeline</span></div><div style=\"padding:14px;\"><div style=\"position:relative;padding-left:16px;border-left:2px solid #e9d5ff;margin-left:6px;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:-5px;top:2px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#7c3aed;\"></div><div style=\"background:#faf5ff;border:1px solid #e9d5ff;border-radius:8px;padding:8px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;margin-bottom:4px;\"><span>admin@system.com</span><span style=\"color:#94a3b8;font-weight:500;\">5 mins ago</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;\">Updated contact group name to Risk Team Alpha.</div><div style=\"margin-top:4px;padding:2px 6px;background:#dcfce7;color:#16a34a;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;\">✓ SUCCESS</div></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:-5px;top:88px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#c4b5fd;\"></div><div style=\"background:#faf5ff;border:1px solid #e9d5ff;border-radius:8px;padding:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#a78bfa;margin-bottom:4px;\"><span>operator@bank.com</span><span style=\"color:#94a3b8;font-weight:500;\">2 hours ago</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;\">Created contact group Risk Team.</div><div style=\"margin-top:4px;padding:2px 6px;background:#dcfce7;color:#16a34a;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;\">✓ SUCCESS</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Portal View Contacts (Detail Dialog)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tombol **View Contacts** (berwarna ungu) tersedia di Detail Panel tab General, baik di Card View maupun Table View.\n• Klik tombol ini untuk membuka **Contact Group Detail Dialog** — panel drawer berukuran **1000px** yang menampilkan daftar seluruh kontak anggota grup.\n\n**Fitur di dalam portal View Contacts:**\n- **Add Contact**: Membuka drawer *Add Contacts* dengan **MultiSelect** — pilih satu atau lebih kontak sekaligus. Hanya menampilkan kontak yang platform-nya **sesuai** dengan platform grup.\n- **Delete Contact (Bulk)**: Centang satu atau lebih kontak menggunakan checkbox, lalu klik tombol **Delete Contact** yang muncul di toolbar untuk memutus kaitan kontak dari grup (data Contact Setup asli tidak terhapus).\n- **Search**: Klik tombol **Search** untuk membuka panel filter dengan 4 kriteria: **Firstname**, **Lastname**, **Contact** (alamat kontak), dan **Platform**.\n- **Detail Panel kontak**: Klik salah satu baris kontak untuk membuka Detail Panel kontak (read-only) di sebelah kanan.",
          "color": "#0ea5e9",
          "bg": "#f0f9ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#fff;width:480px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9d5ff;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5f3ff,#ede9fe);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c3aed,#4f46e5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z\"/><path d=\"M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Risk Team Alpha</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Manage contacts within this group</div></div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#ede9fe;border:1px solid #c4b5fd;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;\">● Group</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 16px;background:#faf5ff;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:8px;\">Contact Management</div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Contact Setup</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:5px;\"><div style=\"padding:5px 9px;border-radius:6px;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;\">Search</div><div style=\"padding:5px 9px;border-radius:6px;background:#ef4444;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">Delete Contact</div><div style=\"padding:5px 9px;border-radius:6px;background:#7c3aed;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">+ Add Contact</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"border:1.5px solid #7c3aed;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#faf5ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"accent-color:#7c3aed;width:13px;height:13px;\"/><div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:6px;background:#7c3aed;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">John Doe</div><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#64748b;font-family:monospace;\">john.doe@email.com</div></div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 7px;background:rgba(234,179,8,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(234,179,8,0.3);border-radius:4px;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#ca8a04;\">Email</span></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#fff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" style=\"accent-color:#7c3aed;width:13px;height:13px;\"/><div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:6px;background:#7c3aed;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Alice Smith</div><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#64748b;font-family:monospace;\">alice.smith@email.com</div></div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 7px;background:rgba(234,179,8,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(234,179,8,0.3);border-radius:4px;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#ca8a04;\">Email</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Add Contact: MultiSelect & Filter Platform",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik tombol **Add Contact** di dalam portal View Contacts untuk membuka drawer *Add Contacts* (560px).\n• Terdapat field **Contacts** berupa **MultiSelect** — Anda dapat memilih lebih dari satu kontak sekaligus dalam satu operasi.\n• Sistem **hanya menampilkan kontak yang platform-nya sesuai** dengan platform grup (contoh: jika grup ber-platform Email, hanya kontak Email yang bisa dipilih).\n• Setiap item di dropdown menampilkan **Nama kontak** dan **nilai alamat kontak** (Contact Value) sebagai deskripsi.\n• Klik **Add** untuk menghubungkan semua kontak terpilih ke dalam grup sekaligus.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9d5ff;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5f3ff,#ede9fe);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c3aed,#4f46e5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><line x1=\"19\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"14\"/><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"11\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Add Contacts</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Select contacts to add to this group</div></div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#ede9fe;border:1px solid #c4b5fd;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;\">● Add</span></div><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:10px;\">Contact Selection</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Contacts <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"border:1.5px solid #7c3aed;border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 8px;background:#faf5ff;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;min-height:32px;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 7px;background:#7c3aed;color:#fff;border-radius:4px;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;\">John Doe <span style=\"opacity:.7;\">×</span></span><span style=\"padding:2px 7px;background:#7c3aed;color:#fff;border-radius:4px;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;\">Alice Smith <span style=\"opacity:.7;\">×</span></span></div><div style=\"padding:4px 6px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #e9d5ff;\"><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px;font-size:9.5px;color:#475569;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\"><div><div style=\"font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Bob Johnson</div><div style=\"font-size:8.5px;color:#94a3b8;font-family:monospace;\">bob.johnson@email.com</div></div><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#faf5ff;display:flex;gap:8px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#7c3aed;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(124,58,237,.35);\">Add</button></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
